# Plan Mode: Front-End Error Recovery

## File Purpose and Relationship

This file provides a planning template specifically designed for error recovery strategies in front-end development for the PolygonExpress project. It structures planning documentation to prepare for robust error handling, recovery mechanisms, and graceful degradation approaches.

This file complements:
- **front-end-workflow-reference.md**: Core front-end development workflow 
- **dev-mode-error-recovery.md**: Implementation companion to this planning template
- **log-based-process.md**: Log-based development approach for error diagnosis

## Usage as Project-Rule-Parameter

This file is a Manual rule type and should be referenced as a project-rule-parameter in the plan-mode message-command:

```
plan-mode: front-end-workflow @parameters/front-end/plan-mode/plan-mode-error-recovery.mdc
```

## Error Recovery Planning Structure

When this template is applied, the planning folder will be structured as follows:

```
planning/
  ├── requirements.md (Feature requirements with error case specifications)
